{
  "info": {
    "name": "FIAP Fase 3 - Sistema Hospitalar (Microsserviços)",
    "description": "Collection unica dos 3 microsserviços do projeto FIAP Fase 3.\n\n- scheduling-service (8081): Auth JWT + CRUD de consultas + usuários\n- notification-service (8082): consulta de notificações (REST)\n- history-service (8083): histórico via GraphQL\n\nAs variáveis (URLs dos 3 serviços, token, IDs) ficam embutidas na propria collection (collectionVariables), sem environment separado. A pasta 'local' cobre o ambiente Docker Compose. Um pre-request no nível da collection faz auto-login e seta o token quando estiver vazio.\n\nFluxo: rode 'Selecionar ambiente local', depois a pasta Auth (register DOCTOR/PATIENT + login salvam token e IDs), depois Scheduling, Users, Notification e History.\n\nCompatível com Postman, Bruno e Newman (schema Collection v2.1.0).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-login no nivel da collection: se nao houver token e ja existirem",
          "// credenciais de DOCTOR salvas, faz login automatico antes de cada request.",
          "const token = pm.collectionVariables.get('token');",
          "const email = pm.collectionVariables.get('doctorEmail');",
          "const password = pm.collectionVariables.get('doctorPassword');",
          "const base = pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl');",
          "if (!token && email && password && base) {",
          "  pm.sendRequest({",
          "    url: base + '/api/v1/auth/login',",
          "    method: 'POST',",
          "    header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },",
          "    body: { mode: 'raw', raw: JSON.stringify({ email: email, password: password }) }",
          "  }, function (err, res) {",
          "    if (!err && res && res.code === 200) {",
          "      pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.json().token);",
          "      console.log('[pre-request] auto-login OK, token setado');",
          "    } else {",
          "      console.log('[pre-request] auto-login falhou', err || res.code);",
          "    }",
          "  });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "local",
      "description": "Ambiente local (Docker Compose). Seta baseUrl/notificationUrl/historyUrl para localhost.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Selecionar ambiente local",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('baseUrl', pm.collectionVariables.get('localScheduling'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('notificationUrl', pm.collectionVariables.get('localNotification'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('historyUrl', pm.collectionVariables.get('localHistory'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', '');",
                  "pm.test('ambiente local selecionado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200));",
                  "pm.test('scheduling UP', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('UP'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{localScheduling}}/actuator/health",
              "host": [ "{{localScheduling}}" ],
              "path": [ "actuator", "health" ]
            },
            "description": "Rode este request primeiro para apontar as variáveis para o ambiente local."
          }
        },
